# Nate
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: High-skill gymnastics AMRAP with a heavy kettlebell; every round costs the shoulders.
AMRAP 20
2 Muscle-up
4 Handstand push-up
8 Kettlebell swing 2/1.5 pood

Scaled:
  Muscle-up -> Chest-to-bar pull-up
  Handstand push-up -> Push-up
  Kettlebell swing 1.5/1 pood
